Hi! this is a geography guessing game. Here you can play geography quiz and spend a productive funtime.


Here are the three main pages of this website:
1) index.html: In this file there is a landing page. It tells about the website and features of this website, then gives link to the quiz game and the stats pannel.  What this page contains:
1)Header containing the Quizzler    navigation bar
2)Main area with title, description, and buttons
3)Right-hand area containing the mascot
4)Footer with some details of when this website was made

2) quiz.html: In this file there is a quiz pannel in which the users can show their geography rizz by correctly guessing all the questions.What this page contains:
1)Proper Navigation Bar
2)Quiz Container
3)Question Progress and Score 
4)Options containing the answers
5)Next question button
 

3) stats.html: In this file there is a leaderboard where you can see the people with highest geography rizz.

Structure of this website:
It contains the following files with following structure:

Quizzler/
├── index.html       # Landing page
├── quiz.html        # Geography quiz interface
├── stats.html       # Stats and leaderboard page
├── style.css        # Shared website styling (contains layout of the entire website)
└── README,MD        # Project documentation